<p>
This package contains models for air-cooled IT racks.
For air-cooled IT racks with rear door heat exchangers, see the package
<a href=\"modelica://Buildings.Fluid.DataCenters.Racks.Hybrid\">
Buildings.Fluid.DataCenters.Racks.Hybrid</a>.
</p>
</html>"));
end Air;
